sgk-voice-typer (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Tray appears immediately; the model loads in the background (dimmed icon).
  * Live preview transcribes only the last 20 s with greedy decoding.
  * No idle polling: tray and overlay update through Qt signals.
  * Keyboards plugged in after start are picked up; virtual keyboards ignored.
  * Paste waits for physically held keys to be released first.
  * Fixes: release delivered while paused; non-text clipboard no longer
    restored as garbage; separate paste settle delay in Settings.
  * One autostart scheme (XDG entry); systemd unit removed. --install-service
    is now --install.
  * Donate link removed; version read from the package.

 -- SGK <sidash.seo@gmail.com>  Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:00:00 +0300

sgk-voice-typer (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Hands-free lock (hold to latch recording), configurable or disabled.
  * Live transcript preview in the on-screen overlay while speaking.
  * Start/stop sound cues: on/off from the settings dialog and the tray
    menu, six selectable styles with an in-dialog preview button.
  * Settings dialog: Audio tab renamed to Microphone.

 -- SGK <sidash.seo@gmail.com>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0300

sgk-voice-typer (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Rewrite to the wordwrap architecture: PyQt6 tray, JSON config, structured
    logging, single-instance guard, self-install.
  * Wayland text injection via uinput (replaces wtype).
  * Second hotkey for terminals (Shift+F9) instead of window detection.

 -- SGK <sidash.seo@gmail.com>  Wed, 10 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0300
